// Orbital Lab — a 2001 / Moon station console: matte white moulded panels
// with soft seams and generous radii, flush keys whose edges glow through a
// light pipe, a black glass screen set deep into the white, and a single
// red-orange status light. Clinical, bright, calm.
//
// Assignments only, over the base templates in `src/hw.rs`
// (see local/agent_state/skeuomorph/music/STYLE_GUIDE.md).
